3. The present Writ Petition has been filed with the following prayer:-
"It is therefore, humbly prayed that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to issue RULE NISI, calling upon the opposite parties, to show cause and on perusal of cause shown make the said Rule absolute and be further pleased to;
(i) issue a writ of mandamus or any other writ or order directing the opposite parties to identify the petitioners as "Displaced Families" and to provide them Rehabilitation & Resettlement benefits under the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitations and Resettlement Act, 2013."

